                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Beaupré.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>You may avail yourself of leave of absence under authorization cabled to you July
                    9.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
